  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Indonesia Institute Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia and Indonesia are close neighbours and strategic partners, and our governments have set an ambitious agenda for deeper and broader cooperation. Through its programs and activities, the Australia-Indonesia Institute (AII) plays an important role in supporting the Australian government&#x2019;s strategic foreign policy objectives with Indonesia. This investment, the &#x2018;AII Initiative&#x2019;, is designed to allow DFAT to better articulate how ODA and non-ODA funding to AII activities contributes to these strategic objectives, as well as outlining how we will manage risk and monitor performance of AII activities.</narrative>
  </description>
